# Causey data & API

## Seam
- All product reads go through the data-source interface (`lib/data/`). Mock and Supabase must stay behavior-aligned.
- Search returns paginated `CompetitionSearchPage` (`limit` / `offset`). Default page size ~20 — do not load everything on first paint.

## Schemas
- Zod in `lib/schemas.ts` is the contract. API routes validate inputs; do not accept raw unchecked query bags.
- Competition fields like `fingerprint` / `canonical_id` matter for dedupe — preserve them through parse/serialize.

## API routes
- `/api/competitions`, `/api/competitions/[slug]`, `/api/pathways` — keep these the single external surface; UI should call them rather than importing DB clients in client components.

## Honesty
- Do not surface unverified organizer rules as fact. Prefer incomplete + labeled over confident wrong data.
